/// That structure ALSO implies the body itself cannot reach a modeled panic
/// (no `Assert`/branch/drop terminators, no effectful statements, only total
/// callees — any other shape fails closed), which is exactly what the
/// panic-freedom call gate needs. Consumed by the compiler at native-bundle
