// The stability of `Step` was never the lock. What actually kept it latent were two
// TYPED conjuncts in other places that nothing documented as load-bearing:
// `ty_is_integer_range_iter` (lower.rs, gates the CHC erasure on the LOWERED FIELD TYPES
