                // pointer) and continue, exactly like the range arm above — un-poisoning
                // every `Vec`-scalar-indexing function (which previously aborted the whole
                // lowering at `resolve_call_target`). See `vec_scalar_index_call` for the
                // soundness argument: the OOB bounds check is NOT dropped — it is emitted
                // by the FORMULA lane (trust-vcgen `slice_method_panic_body` now emits a
                // `SliceBoundsCheck` VC `Ge(i, coll_len)` at this index site). Under
                // `-full` that VC has no native certificate from this opaque model, so it
