                // REAL `Inst::Call` into it — its panic-freedom then JOINS this function's verdict
                // (a panicking closure REFUTES here, a total one VERIFIES). EVERY closure-body param
                // — the env `_1` (whatever its ABI: by-value FnOnce `{closure}` or by-ref Fn/FnMut
