                // bundle and dropped this function to UNKNOWN), and is a SOUND over-approximation for
                // panic-freedom: a havoc env is MORE general than the actual captured env, so if the
                // closure body is proven panic-free here it is panic-free for the real env too
                // (conservative refutation, never a false prove). The closure RESULT is discarded and
                // the HOF dest is filled with an independent fresh `Undef` of the wrapper type (no
