                // The conservative arm below throws away a callee whose BODY THIS
                // MODULE ALREADY CONTAINS. Measured on a3d-kernel (2026-09-01): for
                // every one of the 12 INCONCLUSIVE rows the monomorphised consumer —
                // `core::option::Option::<u64>::is_some_and::<{closure@…}>`,
                // `Option::<i64>::and_then::<…>`, `Option::<i64>::map::<…>` — is a
                // fully lowered member of the emitted native bundle, and its body
                // ALREADY contains a real `Inst::Call` into the bundled closure (the
                // `<F as FnOnce>::call_once` callable-trait-shim path). So the
