                // name-trust: emit the ordinary resolved-call edge instead of the
                // `Assert(false)` may-panic marker.
                //
                // WHY THIS IS NOT THE `try_resolve_hof_closure` LANE (checked
                // earlier, and deliberately left untouched): that lane inlines ONLY
